---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Archbishop Peter Comensoli — Our People — IICC Mission" description="His Grace Archbishop Peter Comensoli — Archbishop of Melbourne and supporter of the IICC Mission.">

  <div style="background:var(--color-off-white);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(27,39,81,0.07);">
    <div class="wrap">
      <nav class="breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a><span class="breadcrumb__sep">›</span>
        <a href="/our-people">Our People</a><span class="breadcrumb__sep">›</span>
        <span class="breadcrumb__current">Archbishop Peter Comensoli</span>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="hero-split" style="min-height:480px;">
    <div class="hero-split__text" style="background:#fff;gap:1.25rem;">
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1rem;">
        <img src="/IICC_Logo.png" alt="IICC Mission" style="height:3.5rem;object-fit:contain;" />
        <span style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:0.75rem;letter-spacing:0.15em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--color-amber);font-weight:700;">Church Leadership</span>
      </div>
      <h1 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:900;text-transform:uppercase;line-height:1.05;">
        <span style="display:block;color:var(--color-navy);font-size:clamp(0.875rem,1.5vw,1rem);letter-spacing:0.2em;margin-bottom:0.375rem;">HIS GRACE ARCHBISHOP</span>
        <span style="display:block;color:var(--color-navy);font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3.5vw,2.5rem);">PETER</span>
        <span style="display:block;color:var(--color-amber);font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3.5vw,2.5rem);">COMENSOLI</span>
      </h1>
      <span class="rule rule--amber"></span>
      <p style="font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:1rem;color:var(--color-muted);line-height:1.6;">Archbishop of Melbourne — a shepherd who understands that the Church must walk with the most vulnerable.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-split__photo" style="min-height:320px;position:relative;">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1559757175-5700dde675bc?w=800&h=600&fit=crop" alt="St Patrick's Cathedral Melbourne" />
      <div style="position:absolute;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;background:linear-gradient(transparent,rgba(18,26,56,0.88));padding:2rem 1.5rem 1.5rem;">
        <p style="font-size:0.875rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-amber);letter-spacing:0.08em;">Archdiocese of Melbourne, Victoria, Australia</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="section section--offwhite">
    <div class="wrap" style="max-width:860px;">
      <div class="cols-2" style="gap:3rem;align-items:start;">
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow" style="display:block;margin-bottom:0.5rem;">The Archbishop of Melbourne</span>
          <h2 class="section-title" style="margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Acknowledgement &amp; Endorsement</h2>
          <span class="rule rule--amber" style="display:block;margin-bottom:1.25rem;"></span>
          <p class="section-desc" style="max-width:none;margin-bottom:1rem;">
            His Grace Archbishop Peter Comensoli of Melbourne has acknowledged the extraordinary pastoral mission of IICC Mission and its founder, Ambassador Antonio G. Dattilo, in serving the incarcerated, the detained and the marginalised.
          </p>
          <p class="section-desc" style="max-width:none;margin-bottom:1rem;">
            Archbishop Comensoli's own pastoral commitment to the poor and vulnerable aligns deeply with the charism of IICC Mission. His support and recognition has been a source of great encouragement and spiritual validation for our ministry.
          </p>
          <p class="section-desc" style="max-width:none;">
            We are grateful to Archbishop Comensoli for his shepherding of the Archdiocese of Melbourne and for his willingness to acknowledge the mission work of those serving at the margins of society.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1.5rem;">
          <div style="background:var(--color-navy-dark);border-radius:2px;padding:1.5rem;text-align:center;">
            <div style="width:3rem;height:3rem;border-radius:50%;background:var(--color-gold);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-inline:auto;margin-bottom:1rem;font-size:1.25rem;color:#fff;">✝</div>
            <p style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:0.75rem;letter-spacing:0.15em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--color-amber);margin-bottom:0.5rem;">ARCHDIOCESE OF MELBOURNE</p>
            <p style="font-size:0.875rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);line-height:1.65;">Archbishop Peter Comensoli serves as the spiritual leader of over 1 million Catholics across Victoria, Australia.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="quote-box">
            <span class="quote-box__mark">"</span>
            <p class="quote-box__text">The Church is called to be present wherever people suffer — behind walls, in detention centres and in the streets. This is where Christ waits for us.</p>
            <span class="quote-box__ref">— Inspired by Archbishop Comensoli's pastoral vision</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
